Ticket Title: Design and Implement OpenShift MCP-Based Platform Chatbot

Description / Implementation Tasks:

Design the MCP-based chatbot architecture integrating the UI, LLM, MCP client/server, and OpenShift API.

Develop a chatbot interface with multi-cluster discovery and selection capabilities.

Integrate OpenShift OAuth/LDAP authentication and RBAC-based user authorization.

Develop MCP tools for listing namespaces, pods, deployments, services, and routes.

Implement secure deployment restart and deletion operations with permission checks and audit logging.

Containerize the application and configure Jenkins CI/CD pipelines using internal registries.

Deploy to OpenShift using Deployments, Services, Routes, ConfigMaps, and Secrets, followed by end-to-end testing.
